  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f5",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 520,
      "text": "05 · How we measure it"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 1400,
      "h": 520,
      "text": "04 · My work"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 860,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "03 · The product"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · Why it happens"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · Problem"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "The context lives in chat"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Requirements, decisions and who does what are all worked out in IM."
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Context lives in IM**\nNeeds, decisions and owners all get settled in the group chat, not in documents."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Models can't use it**\nWhen it's time for a spec, a task table or a report, the model can't draw on that context."
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "IM is fragmented; a model needs clean context"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "So the scenario comes down to two problems."
    },
    {
      "id": "fr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 250,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Fragmented**\nOne requirement is spread over dozens of messages across days, mixed with small talk, said casually."
    },
    {
      "id": "nd",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 250,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**What a model needs**\nContext that is relevant to the task at hand, complete and clean."
    },
    {
      "id": "two",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 246,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**Two problems**"
    },
    {
      "id": "st",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 902,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 270,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Storage**\nkeep the chat’s context in a better form"
    },
    {
      "id": "se",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 902,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 270,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Selection**\npick exactly the right context when it’s needed"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Lark Loom: an agent that lives in the group chat"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "It listens all the time, picks up intent without an @, and turns discussion into docs, tables and slides."
    },
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Group chat**\nthe team talks it through"
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Always listening**\n9 kinds of intent, no @ needed"
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Memory**\nstructured memories, not raw messages"
    },
    {
      "id": "w1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Skill**\none of 13 presets; only Q&A needs an @"
    },
    {
      "id": "w2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Recall**\nthe context this task needs, from Memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "w3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Output**\nin Lark Base, Docs and Slides"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Two things I owned"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A: redesigned storage and selection.   B: tiered the models by how hard each subtask is."
    },
    {
      "id": "ta",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · Storage and selection, redesigned**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Before**\nSemantic similarity over the raw history; the top 20 went to the model."
    },
    {
      "id": "dr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 284,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Recall drifts**\nIM is so fragmented that close in meaning isn't what the task needs."
    },
    {
      "id": "so",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 572,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Storage**\nSeed 1.5 Lite extracts messages into structured Memory."
    },
    {
      "id": "sl",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Selection, two paths**\n- Keywords: exact match reins in the drift\n- Task type: bounds what gets recalled"
    },
    {
      "id": "ra",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**65% → 80%**\npass rate on a 60-case eval set"
    },
    {
      "id": "tb",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · Models tiered by subtask**"
    },
    {
      "id": "lt",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Deterministic work → Seed 1.5 Lite**\nContext extraction, structuring."
    },
    {
      "id": "pr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 356,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Core reasoning and generation → Seed 2.0 Pro**\nOnly that."
    },
    {
      "id": "tk",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 684,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "Fewer tokens for the large model to read and write."
    },
    {
      "id": "rb",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 926,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**95s → 50s**\nper task, −47%; spot checks: same quality"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Quality and speed"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Did the model get the task right, and did it answer in time?"
    },
    {
      "id": "mq",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Quality**\npass rate on the eval set"
    },
    {
      "id": "mq2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 704,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**Built from the task, not the recall**\nThe set is distilled from what completing the task takes and from the model’s reasoning chains: given this context, does the model get the task right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Speed**\naverage time per task"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Why it matters**\nThe agent lives in a group chat. Answer too slowly, and the rhythm of the conversation breaks."
    }
  ],
